- Trigger event: When an attempt at recreating the arms appeared, warehouse access was sealed


### Person Nargiz Yusupova (Nargiz)

- Name: Nargiz Yusupova. "Nargiz" at the lodging. Ledger Hangul Nargiz
- Character ID: K1015
- Birthplace: Jayang
- Gender: man
- Rank: none
