| [G07E08 · Raider Elite Squad](/wiki/Hostile-Group-G07/#g07e08) | Person | Pack or unit | Takes the ladder and car door of the Yongsan–Itaewon transfer freight elevator and the refrigerated container door, and carries the sacks. | Elite | M011 |
