### G21E15 · Yagwanggwi

- Source batch: M034
- Former role class: Strategic encounter
- Links: {"states":["S05","S10"],"theaters":["XT01"]}

| Bestiary item | Record |
|---|---|
| Type | Infected person |
| Battlefield unit | Single individual |
