### G22E15 · Hwama

- Source batch: M036
- Former role class: Strategic encounter
- Links: {"houses":["HP08"],"states":["S06","S11"],"synthetics":["F06"],"theaters":["XT02"]}

| Bestiary item | Record |
|---|---|
